    dct:description "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/def/data-type/string-email/item to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/string-email/item, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/data-types/data-type/string-email/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes. The data type and its version keep their old IRIs as owl:sameAs too."@en ;
